{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34372","headline":"奉和袭美抱疾杜门见寄次韵 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美抱疾杜门见寄次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虽失春城醉上期，下帷裁徧未裁诗。\n因吟郢岸百亩蕙，[欲]采商崖三秀枝。\n栖野鹤笼宽使织，施山僧饭别教炊。\n但医沈约重瞳健，不怕江花不满枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34372.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34372","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}